    "stem": "Consider the following pairs:\n\n| | National Highway | Cities connected |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. | NH4 | Chennai and Hyderabad |\n| 2. | NH6 | Mumbai and Kolkata |\n| 3. | NH15 | Ahmedabad and Jodhpur |\n\nWhich of the above pairs is/are correctly matched?",
